<speak>
<p><s>Welcome back to the channel.</s> <s>Today we look at how a small bakery doubled its sales in one year.</s></p>
<break time="900ms"/>
<p><s>The owner, <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="wɪn">win</phoneme>, started with two ovens and a very simple plan.</s> <s>She baked fresh bread every morning, and she answered every customer by name.</s></p>
<break time="900ms"/>
<p><s>By spring the line reached the corner.</s> <s>That is when she hired her first helper.</s></p>
</speak>
